        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage JH Series Barcelona Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Barcelona has a classic oval design with elegant, curved lines; it features two small oval faces and a graceful sweeping handle. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for entranceways. Universal latch and bolt fits either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the handleset is available  for the door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. Schlage's legendary quality and reliability allow you to focus on other things like selecting just the right finish. With so many finishes to choose from, you'll be sure to find one that is just right for your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dexter Barcelona Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 3 Certification.</li>\r\n<li>Keying: 5-pin, C keyway with two key</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>25 year mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage Dexter Barcelona Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc-based material plated to match the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-1/4\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BAR-hand-specifications.pdf?v=1704262187\"><b>Schlage Barcelona Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.\r\n<br> The Marin Lever is not available in Polished Brass, Bright Chrome, or Aged Bronze. \r\n<br> The LaSalle Lever is not available in Bright Chrome. \r\n<br> The Torino Lever is not available in Polished Brass. \r\n<br> The Seville Lever is not available in Polished Brass.  \r\n<br> The Solstice Lever is not available in Polished Brass. \r\n</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Barcelona Single Cylinder Handleset, Schlage JH60BAR",
                "description": "Schlage JH60BAR Dexter Barcelona Handleset - The Barcelona has a classic oval design with elegant, curved lines; it features two small oval faces and a graceful sweeping handle. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for entranceways. Universal latch and bolt fits either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the handleset is available  for the door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.",
